<div class="etf-grid" id="etfGrid"></div>

<div class="section-label">STEP 3 · 配置總覽</div>
<div class="budget-bar" id="budgetBar"></div>

<div class="section-label">每季配息與二代健保補充保費試算</div>
<table id="quarterTable">
  <thead><tr><th>ETF</th><th>股數</th><th>單季配息</th><th>健保門檻</th><th>補充保費(2.11%)</th><th>季實領</th></tr></thead>
